Description: hw/timer: Add the i.MX21 general purpose timer
 The i.MX21's GPT1-3 are the older i.MX1-style timer: one compare and
 one capture register (TCTL, TPRER, TCMP, TCR, TCN, TSTAT), in restart
 or free-running mode, unlike the i.MX25/31 GPT. Capture is not modelled.
 .
 Compare events are latched on register access as well as from the timer
 callback, and in restart mode a late event holds the count at the
 compare value until it is acknowledged, so a clock built from jiffies
 and the counter never runs backwards however late the host timer fires.
